-packed gunfights using real movement. Become the action hero of your dreams and experience intense combat by navigating seemingly endless levels with your own two feet. Blast bad guys with an extensive arsenal of weaponry, fend off hordes of zombies, and play through a variety of different game modes that keep the adrenaline pumping!\n\nBullet Style requires a minimum of 6.5 feet by 6.5 feet to be played with real movement. A larger play area will improve the game experience. Thumbstick controls can be enabled for stationary play, but this is not recommended.\n\nBullet Style is currently in early access and may contain bugs or other issues. Please report any bugs to contact@adventurousstudios.com. ", "short_description": "Welcome to Bullet Style! An all-new roomscale virtual reality shooter that immerses players in action-packed gunfights using real movement. Become the action hero of your dreams and experience intense combat by navigating seemingly endless levels with your own two feet. Blast bad guys with an extensive arsenal of weaponry, fend off hordes of zombies, and play through a variety of different game modes that keep the adrenaline pumping!"}]}, "developer_name": "Adventurous Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.adventurousstudios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.adventurousstudios.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Adventurous Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.adventurousstudios.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.adventurousstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8857380890942908"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2409837556074773"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2409837556074773"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1726259340, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2409837556074773"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27212780158309702", "version": "2.2.3"}, "id": "920368383281053", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8857380884276242", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27212780158309702"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "920368383281053"}]}, "change_log": "Fixes\n- Fixed issue with certain rooms transitioning at the incorrect time in Gunfight mode\n- Fixed issue with room causing dead end in Gunfight mode\n- Fixed issue with arsenal quick access buttons loading incorrect pages", "created_date": 1774997969, "id": "27212780158309702", "version": "2.2.3", "version_code": 12, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8857380884276242", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27212780158309702"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "920368383281053"}]}, "change_log": "New Content\n- Added Infection mode\n- Added Hospital level\n- Added follow logic to entities\n- Added zombie entities\n- Added rearm functionality\n- Added score system\n- Added aim assist, score popups, texture quality, anti-aliasing, head-tilt body lock, and hand angle settings\n\nUpdates\n- Overhauled Gunfight mode to support improved enemy randomization\n- Improved breaching charge attachment logic\n- Added placement indicator to breaching charge\n\nFixes\n- Fixed issue with boundary setup incorrectly rotating play area\n- Fixed issue with some entities moving erratically when reaching a destination\n- Fixed issue with breaching charge not sticking to surfaces", "created_date": 1774214257, "id": "27114382231482829", "version": "2.2.2", "version_code": 11, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8857380884276242", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27212780158309702"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "920368383281053"}]}, "change_log": "Updates\n- Added demonstration video to boundary setup\n- Added destruction timer on magazines dropped from weapons\n- Optimized entity animations\n\nFixes\n- Fixed issue with M41 magazine sticking in weapon\n- Fixed issue with inserted magazines going into socket rather than weapon when overlapping with inventory socket\n- Fixed issue with entity armour break particle effect moving after entity death", "created_date": 1758562668, "id": "25427797210141348", "version": "2.2.1", "version_code": 10, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8857380884276242", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27212780158309702"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "920368383281053"}]}, "change_log": "New Content\n- Added Demo Mission\n- Added grenade enemies\n- Added grenade enemies to Demo Gunfight mode\n- Added new ballistics system (player fired rounds will now penetrate surfaces)\n\nUpdates\n- Minor changes to arsenal, menu console\n- Updated ballistics logic to support surface penetration (rounds will now penetrate certain surfaces and enemies to varying degrees)\n- Increased enemy body armour and helmet armour values from 1 to 2\n- Increase 5.56x45m and 9mm round penetration value from 1 to 2\n- Increased enemy health from 100 to 250 to account for new damage and penetration values\n- Increased easy rifle enemy accuracy slightly\n- Updated M41 magazine mesh\n- Updated G39 magazine mesh\n- Decreased enemy arm collider size\n- Optimized menu level background\n\nFixes\n- Temporary hotfix for issue with some dropped magazines persisting throughout levels", "created_date": 1754415983, "id": "25016751561245917", "version": "2.2.0", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8857380884276242", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27212780158309702"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "920368383281053"}]}, "change_log": "- Added additional enemy variants to demo level\n- Added additional room variants to demo level\n- Added colliders to enemy weapons\n- Added maximum size limit of 25m^2\n- Added custom socket positioning to certain items\n- Increased slide charge threshold on MX4 Interceptor and variants to make checking the chamber easier\n- Increased spawn rates on demo level\n- Fixed issue with enemies in melee state being able to damage the player when unloaded or dead\n- Fixed issue where firearm handling portion of tutorial gets stuck due to player manually releasing slide rather than pressing the slide release\n- Fixed issue where player could open the pause menu while prompted to retry a level which could lead to unintended behaviour\n- Fixed melee collider positioning on rifle enemies\n- Lowered damage value on 556 rounds from 50 to 45 to keep from killing enemies in one shot to the torso\n- Fixed issue with killhouse, shoothouse room variants loading incorrect rooms\n- Fixed issue with grenades not going off when room unloads while fuse is active\n- Fixed issue with weapon melee not registering hits", "created_date": 1751403248, "id": "24715425451378531", "version": "2.1.0", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}